1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,180
Narrator: Listen to a teacher talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:05,900
Teacher: At the discretion of the campus police

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:09,436
and in accordance with standard security policies,

4
00:00:09,436 --> 00:00:16,110
students will no longer be required to show their school ID cards in the school cafeteria.

5
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:22,089
We hope that this change will make your dining experience more pleasant as some students

6
00:00:22,089 --> 00:00:27,780
who forgot to bring their ID cards have been refused to eat in there

7
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:30,060
and we want to change that.
